{"type":"message","id":"bdf742b3","parentId":"3abee868","timestamp":"2026-05-14T07:32:51.017Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Evaluating tool limitations**\n\nI need to take action but must show each change before applying anything. First, it’s essential to inspect. The tools can read, write, or apply patches but can’t execute code. I should validate if the file exists by reading /data/last_event.json. I want to log using a script, but it looks like the execution tool isn't available, maybe it's blocked. So, I’ll take it step by step and read the necessary files.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a057a9f1ca08191acf902c56e9ff8af\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABqBXqiRuzI0iHbND14brYd8zuGUiopKJM7wl29GuBnmvISt1dhGu46Einr2uQa1okYVrpfvNSO_MhVPyTZ5OTHhtjxZwfJGO5gaW_7oGxuMmK6jAqmaUsHCgkZH-BvucOowB14_SYGlV4IgxvT0ZtxXS2ZMLp3FX_KrVQWWKkH6qX4MTnz5f59gIZfq6GOAhCK1vwrKjEgtZ2-El0k-JuhsU7TxN5FtIH_z5whnwdD3ZX1xp3NFHsdEcAdIpQkeZwe6lbLIALF59g98B9VRkDT1xCbnhXpaKwih8ODuzhxwSKn_RsnPOmW92i261OjfXPW7rRWfUJNyD5XTjr6NZHXARItLOuYbI5BaM_BWzzh3BIfRzhs-Jw-Jk2i8eegsrBefo3AQkBycn4lsPPEg8gP089Y5cK1gm4NghUG38x16MCrcLDsLRG6I-v127L29cH0DC2_ZIfXjqaJYTW53bse2ETrehxGeXTrjv0zAlcSz0q32ikwcS2hum8vUyp9Mt1gAgK5Z1VwW30tkG0N8Sn_JFv1PFKQwyOuqUflP3nT2VWBw88a4fqd9yLn-5xQFbZH95XhEJTm3cRssGxEcGMNnNtcFt47zL7h0acpRRYO_zmviAKDyROoZBXI9XyXOMmnBBhwOx8GSSWemA2g3dNf_oIyf1CdhOcvpcLeunWioyP80Kei8bccZG0zevYnGgc9eek3Qpnlnk6SW_7RwhfT0XnJgXCJ71E24xdO0zr-cEuFMLJ6pXpyh2TZmlbA9bm2ggQr9pbL-PLdL9GvYPHoQAHN9ACwjqsX6VOZZ4FEd3LeeTPB4OzNKlq8QilZOjvPbmTL0STjZi50gxmrrCIiQH5HQFDJBRK1wxzy9FRLYPxu3DRFEC_EeNp8MfnJWHAwhER7wfIHaq1SgbBJkRyMVNN6xeLTMyUfKEm04wKSlFAT9uS1ewiWdiQisb5df_FhAeavsp8z_iYLeIqfE4kRoGNVZZCPhj_2DkXaxipKxNGwtnXCUvy0XFr7RHKyZsAuvS998Ifl7CF86Os-qR3FsW1cNwlhggYuUAto5k_eWnBXxn0twiFFQx0WK_X-1GmpPnyk2vMKu6iLT-gvB7PkaXN4EjzD9gOQvlgast70dSH7hMCKB5Owaww0_TARtU4TIlsL8_qB787HTP48kI-3DcmGahe_tGxMwK3ngWxpaMj2f6D5pIzhMe0j_-fKihfvEaJJOpiFREHA4pf-iX_7t-5VfQd8JW7c-dGkjV17Nsv_hb2nu72PWbBgMzlZQbkNwLjb\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Evaluating tool limitations**\\n\\nI need to take action but must show each change before applying anything. First, it’s essential to inspect. The tools can read, write, or apply patches but can’t execute code. I should validate if the file exists by reading /data/last_event.json. I want to log using a script, but it looks like the execution tool isn't available, maybe it's blocked. So, I’ll take it step by step and read the necessary files.\"}]}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_PDSNBZWVuV6HXinM98JJmawp|fc_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a057aa2f8e48191a3f60b42b1865570","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/main/dashboard-v2/index.html","limit":2000}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_vHm29rXZrQ92BcbUNDlY1d4Z|fc_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a057aa2f8f88191831b9edf032cd081","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/data/last_event.json","limit":200}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_GX8JLNzMHgE5Rzf1KNgctvwK|fc_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a057aa2f90081918a3e6a40ddef16cb","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/main/dashboard-v2","limit":50}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_Hp5j5xqAdID3aWHxqnrZIRwJ|fc_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a057aa2f90c81918aab1fc8bfb4bf4e","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/main/log_event_v2.sh","limit":200}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_PF0Yyslrhv4xE0n6ZagGhTVy|fc_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a057aa2f914819188b548440884dd1c","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/logs/runtime/events.jsonl","limit":20}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":7647,"output":213,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":7860,"cost":{"input":0.038235000000000005,"output":0.00639,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.044625000000000005}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778743964969,"responseId":"resp_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a057a9e2fb8819184a2cb34af747304"}}
{"type":"message","id":"0af7f6c2","parentId":"bdf742b3","timestamp":"2026-05-14T07:32:51.062Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_PDSNBZWVuV6HXinM98JJmawp|fc_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a057aa2f8e48191a3f60b42b1865570","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"es\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Neodaemon · Dashboard v2</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      color-scheme: dark;\n      --bg: #0d1117;\n      --panel: #161b22;\n      --panel-2: #1f2630;\n      --panel-soft: rgba(31, 38, 48, .55);\n      --text: #e6edf3;\n      --muted: #8b949e;\n      --accent: #58a6ff;\n      --ok: #3fb950;\n      --warn: #d29922;\n      --border: #30363d;\n    }\n\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(88, 166, 255, .08), transparent 34vw),\n        var(--bg);\n      color: var(--text);\n      line-height: 1.45;\n    }\n\n    main {\n      width: 100vw;\n      max-width: none;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 10px 12px 16px;\n    }\n\n    header {\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 16px;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n    }\n\n    h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }\n\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0 0 6px;\n      font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2rem);\n      letter-spacing: .01em;\n    }\n\n    h2 {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 1.08rem;\n      color: var(--accent);\n      letter-spacing: .02em;\n    }\n\n    h3 {\n      margin: 0 0 8px;\n      font-size: .98rem;\n      color: var(--accent);\n    }\n\n    .brand {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 12px;\n      min-width: 0;\n    }\n\n    .brand-mark {\n      width: 44px;\n      height: 44px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      display: grid;\n      place-items: center;\n      flex: 0 0 auto;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(88, 166, 255, .35);\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #162033 0%, rgba(31, 38, 48, .65) 70%);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(88, 166, 255, .12);\n      font-size: 1.35rem;\n    }\n\n    .subtitle, .muted, footer { color: var(--muted); }\n    .subtitle { margin: 0; }\n\n    .header-status {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 8px;\n      align-items: center;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n      justify-content: flex-end;\n    }\n\n    .nav-link {\n      display: inline-block;\n      padding: 3px 8px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: rgba(88, 166, 255, .08);\n      color: #9fc9ff;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(88, 166, 255, .45);\n      font-size: .82rem;\n      margin: 2px 3px 2px 0;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n      text-decoration: none;\n    }\n\n    .nav-link:hover,\n    .nav-link:focus {\n      border-color: var(--accent);\n      color: var(--text);\n    }\n\n    .grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      grid-template-rows: repeat(2, minmax(390px, auto));\n      gap: 10px;\n      align-items: stretch;\n      width: calc(100vw - 24px);\n      max-width: none;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n\n    .dashboard-block {\n      background: var(--panel);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 18px;\n      padding: 14px;\n      min-width: 0;\n      min-height: 0;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 10px;\n      box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, .14);\n    }\n\n    .dashboard-block.tall { grid-row: span 2; }\n\n    .block-section {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 9px;\n      min-height: 0;\n    }\n\n    .block-section + .block-section {\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n      padding-top: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .section-title {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: .82rem;\n      letter-spacing: .08em;\n      text-transform: uppercase;\n    }\n\n    .block-grid {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n      gap: 9px;\n      align-items: stretch;\n    }\n\n    .block-grid.single { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n    .block-grid.fill { flex: 1; }\n\n    .mini-card {\n      background: var(--panel-soft);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      padding: 10px;\n      min-width: 0;\n    }\n\n    .mini-card.primary {\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #162033 0%, rgba(31, 38, 48, .65) 70%);\n      border-color: rgba(88, 166, 255, .35);\n    }\n\n    .mini-card.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }\n    .mini-card.compact { min-height: 96px; }\n\n    .metric {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 10px;\n      padding: 6px 0;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);\n    }\n\n    .metric:last-child { border-bottom: 0; }\n    .metric span { color: var(--muted); }\n    .metric strong { color: var(--text); text-align: right; }\n\n    .pill {\n      display: inline-block;\n      padding: 3px 8px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      color: var(--muted);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      font-size: .82rem;\n      margin: 2px 3px 2px 0;\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n\n    .pill.real {\n      color: #9fc9ff;\n      border-color: rgba(88, 166, 255, .45);\n      background: rgba(88, 166, 255, .08);\n    }\n\n    .pill.placeholder {\n      color: #f0d58c;\n      border-color: rgba(210, 153, 34, .45);\n      background: rgba(210, 153, 34, .08);\n    }\n\n    .pill.policy {\n      color: var(--muted);\n      border-color: var(--border);\n      background: rgba(31, 38, 48, .55);\n    }\n\n    .small { color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }\n\n    .source {\n      margin-top: 10px;\n      padding-top: 10px;\n      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: .88rem;\n    }\n\n    ul { padding-left: 18px; margin: 0; }\n    li { margin: 4px 0; }\n\n    code {\n      background: var(--panel-2);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 1px 5px;\n      color: var(--text);\n    }\n\n    footer {\n      margin-top: 12px;\n      font-size: .9rem;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 1100px) {\n      .grid {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n        grid-template-rows: none;\n        width: 100%;\n      }\n      .dashboard-block.tall { grid-row: auto; }\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 720px) {\n      main { padding: 9px; }\n      .grid { width: 100%; }\n      .block-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n      .mini-card.full { grid-column: auto; }\n      .metric { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }\n      .metric strong { text-align: left; }\n      .header-status { justify-content: flex-start; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main>\n    <header>\n      <div class=\"brand\">\n        <div class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⚙️</div>\n        <div>\n          <h1>Neodaemon · Dashboard v2</h1>\n          <p class=\"subtitle\">Base limpia, local, privada y read-only · sin datos falsos</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"header-status\" aria-label=\"Estado del dashboard\">\n        <a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"personal/index.html\">Personal</a>\n        <span class=\"pill real\">1 métrica real</span>\n        <span class=\"pill policy\">estático</span>\n        <span class=\"pill policy\">sin servidor</span>\n        <span class=\"pill policy\">sin JS dinámico</span>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"grid\" aria-label=\"Dashboard v2\">\n      <div class=\"dashboard-block tall\">\n        <h2>Control diario</h2>\n\n        <div class=\"block-section\">\n          <h3 class=\"section-title\">Decisiones</h3>\n          <div class=\"mini-card primary full\">\n            <h3>Registro de decisiones</h3>\n            <p class=\"small\">Primera métrica real conectada mediante snapshot estático desde el registro local.</p>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Decisiones registradas</span><strong>15</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Última decisión</span><strong>2026-05-12 · Fase 0 documental Internet STRICT READ-ONLY</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Incertidumbre de formato</span><strong>baja</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"source\">\n              Fuente real: <code>logs/decisions.md</code><br />\n              Snapshot: <code>dashboard-v2/snapshots/decisions-summary.json</code><br />\n              Estado: <span class=\"pill real\">real</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"block-section\">\n          <h3 class=\"section-title\">Gobernanza visual</h3>\n          <div class=\"block-grid fill\">\n            <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n              <h3>Política de datos</h3>\n              <ul class=\"small\">\n                <li>No mostrar valores inventados.</li>\n                <li>No usar ceros como ausencia de datos.</li>\n                <li>Cada métrica real necesita fuente.</li>\n              </ul>\n              <div class=\"source\">Referencia: <code>PLACEHOLDERS_POLICY.md</code></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n              <h3>Estado operativo</h3>\n              <div class=\"metric\"><span>Servidor</span><strong>no usado</strong></div>\n              <div class=\"metric\"><span>Launcher</span><strong>no usado</strong></div>\n              <div class=\"metric\"><span>Lógica activa</span><strong>no disponible</strong></div>\n              <span class=\"pill policy\">read-only</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"dashboard-block\">\n        <h2>Salud</h2>\n        <div class=\"block-grid single fill\">\n          <div class=\"mini-card primary full\">\n            <h3>Salud privada</h3>\n            <p class=\"small\">Área reservada para registros privados si Albert lo autoriza en una fase posterior.</p>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tensión arterial</span><strong>sin registros</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Movilidad</span><strong>sin datos</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Hábitos</span><strong>sin datos</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"source\">\n              Estado: <span class=\"pill placeholder\">no_disponible</span><br />\n              Sin formularios activos. Sin localStorage. Sin interpretación médica.\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"dashboard-block\">\n        <h2>Observabilidad</h2>\n        <div class=\"block-grid fill\">\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Tokens · último día disponible</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Día</span><strong>2026-05-13</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Total tokens</span><strong>2.77M</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Input</span><strong>326.6k</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Output</span><strong>39.7k</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Cache read</span><strong>2.41M</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Coste</span><strong>4.03</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Entradas válidas</span><strong>85 / 285</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"source\">\n              Fuente: <code>dashboard-v2/snapshots/tokens-daily-summary.json</code><br />\n              Incluye <code>cacheRead</code>. Solo agente <code>main</code>. Usage entries ≠ mensajes humanos.<br />\n              Estado: <span class=\"pill real\">real</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Estabilidad</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Score</span><strong>sin snapshot</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Errores críticos</span><strong>sin fuente</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Reinicios gateway</span><strong>sin fuente</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"source\">\n              Fuente futura: <code>data/metrics/stability/</code><br />\n              Estado: <span class=\"pill placeholder\">no_disponible</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"dashboard-block\">\n        <h2>Sistema documental</h2>\n        <div class=\"block-grid fill\">\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Tools / plugins</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugins</span><strong>sin auditoría</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tools</span><strong>sin inventario</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Acciones</span><strong>no disponibles</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"source\">\n              Fuente futura: <code>data/metrics/tools_plugins/</code><br />\n              Estado: <span class=\"pill placeholder\">no_disponible</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Fuentes locales previstas</h3>\n            <ul class=\"small\">\n              <li><code>data/metrics/</code></li>\n              <li><code>data/health/</code></li>\n              <li><code>data/snapshots/</code></li>\n              <li><code>memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md</code></li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"source\">\n              Política: <span class=\"pill policy\">local</span> <span class=\"pill policy\">privado</span> <span class=\"pill policy\">read-only</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer>\n      Dashboard v2 estático. Si un dato no tiene fuente verificable, se muestra como “sin datos”, “sin snapshot” o “no disponible”.\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n<!-- === METRICS BLOCK === -->\n<div id=\"metrics\" style=\"padding:20px;\">\n  <h2>Resumen diario</h2>\n  <p>Total: <span id=\"total\"></span></p>\n  <p>Éxitos: <span id=\"success\"></span></p>\n  <p>Fallos: <span id=\"fail\"></span></p>\n  <p>Duración media (ms): <span id=\"avg\"></span></p>\n</div>\n\n\n<script>\nfetch('/data/daily_summary.json')\n  .then(response => response.json())\n  .then(data => {\n    document.getElementById('total').textContent = data.total;\n    document.getElementById('success').textContent = data.success;\n    document.getElementById('fail').textContent = data.fail;\n    document.getElementById('avg').textContent = data.avg_duration_ms;\n  })\n  .catch(err => console.error('Error cargando JSON:', err));\n</script>\n\n\n<script>\nsetInterval(() => {\n  fetch('/data/daily_summary.json')\n    .then(response => response.json())\n    .then(data => {\n      document.getElementById('total').textContent = data.total;\n      document.getElementById('success').textContent = data.success;\n      document.getElementById('fail').textContent = data.fail;\n      document.getElementById('avg').textContent = data.avg_duration_ms;\n    });\n}, 5000);\n</script>\n\n\n<div id=\"last-event\" style=\"padding:20px;\">\n  <h2>Último evento</h2>\n  <p>Acción: <span id=\"last_action\"></span></p>\n  <p>Estado: <span id=\"last_status\"></span></p>\n  <p>Duración (ms): <span id=\"last_duration\"></span></p>\n</div>\n\n\n<script>\nsetInterval(() => {\n  fetch('/data/last_event.json')\n    .then(r => r.json())\n    .then(data => {\n      document.getElementById('last_action').textContent = data.action;\n      document.getElementById('last_status').textContent = data.status;\n      document.getElementById('last_duration').textContent = data.duration_ms;\n    });\n}, 5000);\n</script>\n\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778743971061}}
