{"type":"message","id":"941abd6a","parentId":"31885953","timestamp":"2026-05-14T07:32:59.360Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Improving event management**\n\nI’m thinking about how to improve the index since it already has the last event, but it’s outside the HTML after closing. I need to control this better. I want to show changes before applying them, but I can’t use exec, so I might need to read scripts under the workspace instead. \n\nHowever, reading the directory fails without a list. I could explore reading a specific script like log_event_v2.sh for potential solutions.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a057aa3af3c8191b6dfbb0cc6eff4c7\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABqBXqm_hFFqUxwIiLTgk_3rrsYhAI-5PeefLv3iSaZqpOxYdWunIw_liyejGi-Da1Ko-NRq32Imq4wMT0ONr220ua_8AUYN630quvsXdGTxc7o6-gFVpLE47wEHfHKp2YvlQad4hi0V1DX0TaqpnBhCxyz5CMkn-AR2ZnfQCj5WU1zfK7Obv6V-iJNB4Uwgf_MNcNv883cjN6vLgPKOz_npOdtmHKTWo-giOfaWS9zQyop6ZgczdNtEu5tvXYOnln3r1PtpHIe4dcMFmMFjCBH06__rOwAvbAqXSVVmJQVM_DjVfZNavXXEizkKrnOuUpoJbGikkDeyAvexPz94px4of2bPZAXWKkHXCl2wqG2Ma-CRYyrORroEh2Xwkf8j6ze24qB3SyOlAFUymdGJ-JwxVlfn7PpL7kSDSd0sJ0h1deIggW_argan_FUoAxqqdeJymTIqv3Qo2PlSoMmH3A2wRavOGkegcGkEYayKJBhM6IIQ2UA9KahjCnud7wF-5qr9M9IKWjGMnW7oTfa4fH8410a-nZz79MVG5qEoPNOLyQyLM2BOMHglxeK3pmIQo9muei80SAXHHIgbHVN73BQrBCpB61gi5uKqmfWFwYCnN9kUVxPAk8oIic0ULK6xNoCKhthH2SFbae6kdRa3_IrZzc-jyT119uPx1J6_z9fjHEbAOv_wsEXon-SzVA7fh9wi2I6JXHLVT9bsk0lw3UXTG39-UkmWp4mNMWFpIoqMU7XuqhMCGbJDuCcC_SNfbBku_1t0eJ0fl6gkPSsH4OqZ8OYDovwA71NONyGdgdlait0U79KdIZ-KXieAEJB0aUzfhgIyH2n4fdL69sC4oOtSxYr1vsmOQXd0Tz6unpJjifxiZEIIt2w3eZtYDVIrmYQKtGtW75wWVhsgO__8OygAribjs_lxMxBBl8SsxFco2BIwx3y44MWkCIofvDPDy74I2RUzgxJDFt0apNx9Nmt4g_aPayBVRSobGKiCS_6_sO1zenV2uiKkIUlvZeXE_CCIUZ7kLJHjviX7WwnzwSJbhi0ThWImUaMYAYKPNsG7SOPuqb_raPBrtEJ1Wo8LOqPVB22z9PmbkhsFPttDcuRYWEBzcvtSmvMYS4Fk6mQELk65ccv5iC5bwWDYF-qQTPQtjRyKt4iUZYyUoSs87BX-HbuSYWjCuatH25aNOb1zlh7mBtdIxfp5P94XNf5nfahEkTcWiPd6bZcTEOPDsjUfK4InLONYIxRmRnpQmkC6IUVduWfovrCCylE0N1Nv7xRKYMIU64Thks--Cb5Go1d7VXcCHe2fz3ZlnobSRp0_EhtXlY2QoNIICKuHaaMJUF8o_J1MWpA8qA_HUXrDhvmvqVhbg==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Improving event management**\\n\\nI’m thinking about how to improve the index since it already has the last event, but it’s outside the HTML after closing. I need to control this better. I want to show changes before applying them, but I can’t use exec, so I might need to read scripts under the workspace instead. \\n\\nHowever, reading the directory fails without a list. I could explore reading a specific script like log_event_v2.sh for potential solutions.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"He comprobado el estado inicial y hay dos bloqueos de entorno antes de tocar nada:\n\n1. `index.html` ya contiene un bloque de “Último evento”, pero está añadido después de `</html>`, fuera del documento HTML válido. La mejora correcta sería integrarlo dentro del dashboard.\n2. No puedo validar ni registrar todavía porque las rutas pedidas salen del sandbox actual:\n   - `/data/last_event.json` → bloqueado por sandbox\n   - `/openclaw/logs/runtime/events.jsonl` → bloqueado por sandbox\n   - tampoco encuentro `log_event_v2.sh` en `/openclaw/workspace/main/log_event_v2.sh`\n\nAntes de modificar `index.html`, esta sería la propuesta exacta de cambio:\n\n- Crear backup dentro de la carpeta permitida:\n  - `/openclaw/workspace/main/dashboard-v2/index.html.backup-2026-05-14-last-event`\n- Mover/integrar la sección “Último evento” dentro del bloque “Observabilidad”.\n- Cambiar el script para cargar `/data/last_event.json` al inicio y refrescar cada 5s.\n- Mostrar fallback `sin datos` si falla la lectura.\n\nPero según tu regla 6 y 7, si algo falla debo detenerme. Ahora mismo falla la validación de `/data/last_event.json` y el registro con `log_event_v2.sh` por falta de acceso/ruta.\n\nMe detengo aquí sin modificar archivos.  \nPara continuar de forma segura necesito que habilites acceso a esas rutas o me indiques dónde está `log_event_v2.sh` dentro de `/openclaw/workspace/main`. \n","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a057aa63efc81919834cfb9ba3c3ff1\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"text","text":"","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a057aab4bec8191816d1bede3ce0749\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":5137,"output":426,"cacheRead":7168,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":12731,"cost":{"input":0.025685000000000003,"output":0.01278,"cacheRead":0.003584,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.042048999999999996}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778743971063,"responseId":"resp_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a057aa339dc8191aca06a5c8cd4de08"}}
