**\\n\\nI need to make sure I comply with the guidelines. Should I show something before applying or modifying? The user didn’t repeat their request, but I think it’s good to stay consistent with prior styles. I wonder if I need a backup or if any restrictions are in place. I should read through the relevant files to clarify the necessary steps before proceeding. It always helps to be cautious!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"De acuerdo. Haré el mismo patrón: integrar “Resumen diario” dentro de Observabilidad, usar `data/daily_summary.json` como ruta web relativa y eliminar el bloque viejo que queda fuera de `</html>`. Primero verifico el estado exacto.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a057c20efc88191aee4e09e37dcb890\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_3H6XB77ST7dgPu0JIkUQZ60E|fc_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a057c2200108191a3471e544e2c4e98","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/main/dashboard-v2/index.html","offset":360,"limit":170}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_FGxQJLUAiZkrHGWNLlAfEcjc|fc_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a057c2200208191b059750ad6e013a1","name":"read","arguments":{"path":"/openclaw/workspace/main/dashboard-v2/data/daily_summary.json","limit":100}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":1993,"output":185,"cacheRead":23552,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25730,"cost":{"input":0.009965000000000002,"output":0.00555,"cacheRead":0.011776,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.027291000000000003}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1778744349075,"responseId":"resp_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a057c1dc8e4819193120cbc1cab029e"}}
{"type":"message","id":"15c18273","parentId":"a481f0d1","timestamp":"2026-05-14T07:39:14.078Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_3H6XB77ST7dgPu0JIkUQZ60E|fc_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a057c2200108191a3471e544e2c4e98","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"\n      <div class=\"dashboard-block\">\n        <h2>Observabilidad</h2>\n        <div class=\"block-grid fill\">\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Tokens · último día disponible</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Día</span><strong>2026-05-13</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Total tokens</span><strong>2.77M</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Input</span><strong>326.6k</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Output</span><strong>39.7k</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Cache read</span><strong>2.41M</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Coste</span><strong>4.03</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Entradas válidas</span><strong>85 / 285</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"source\">\n              Fuente: <code>dashboard-v2/snapshots/tokens-daily-summary.json</code><br />\n              Incluye <code>cacheRead</code>. Solo agente <code>main</code>. Usage entries ≠ mensajes humanos.<br />\n              Estado: <span class=\"pill real\">real</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Estabilidad</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Score</span><strong>sin snapshot</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Errores críticos</span><strong>sin fuente</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Reinicios gateway</span><strong>sin fuente</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"source\">\n              Fuente futura: <code>data/metrics/stability/</code><br />\n              Estado: <span class=\"pill placeholder\">no_disponible</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact full\" id=\"last-event\">\n            <h3>Último evento</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Última acción</span><strong id=\"last_action\">sin datos</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Último estado</span><strong id=\"last_status\">sin datos</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Duración</span><strong><span id=\"last_duration\">sin datos</span> ms</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"source\">\n              Fuente: <code>data/last_event.json</code><br />\n              Estado: <span class=\"pill real\">real</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"dashboard-block\">\n        <h2>Sistema documental</h2>\n        <div class=\"block-grid fill\">\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Tools / plugins</h3>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Plugins</span><strong>sin auditoría</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Tools</span><strong>sin inventario</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"metric\"><span>Acciones</span><strong>no disponibles</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"source\">\n              Fuente futura: <code>data/metrics/tools_plugins/</code><br />\n              Estado: <span class=\"pill placeholder\">no_disponible</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"mini-card compact\">\n            <h3>Fuentes locales previstas</h3>\n            <ul class=\"small\">\n              <li><code>data/metrics/</code></li>\n              <li><code>data/health/</code></li>\n              <li><code>data/snapshots/</code></li>\n              <li><code>memory/YYYY-MM-DD.md</code></li>\n            </ul>\n            <div class=\"source\">\n              Política: <span class=\"pill policy\">local</span> <span class=\"pill policy\">privado</span> <span class=\"pill policy\">read-only</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer>\n      Dashboard v2 estático. Si un dato no tiene fuente verificable, se muestra como “sin datos”, “sin snapshot” o “no disponible”.\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n\n  <script>\n    function renderLastEventFallback() {\n      document.getElementById('last_action').textContent = 'sin datos';\n      document.getElementById('last_status').textContent = 'sin datos';\n      document.getElementById('last_duration').textContent = 'sin datos';\n    }\n\n    function refreshLastEvent() {\n      fetch('data/last_event.json', { cache: 'no-store' })\n        .then(response => {\n          if (!response.ok) throw new Error(`HTTP ${response.status}`);\n          return response.json();\n        })\n        .then(data => {\n          document.getElementById('last_action').textContent = data.action ?? 'sin datos';\n          document.getElementById('last_status').textContent = data.status ?? 'sin datos';\n          document.getElementById('last_duration').textContent = data.duration_ms ?? 'sin datos';\n        })\n        .catch(error => {\n          console.error('Error cargando data/last_event.json:', error);\n          renderLastEventFallback();\n        });\n    }\n\n    refreshLastEvent();\n    setInterval(refreshLastEvent, 5000);\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n\n<!-- === METRICS BLOCK === -->\n<div id=\"metrics\" style=\"padding:20px;\">\n  <h2>Resumen diario</h2>\n  <p>Total: <span id=\"total\"></span></p>\n  <p>Éxitos: <span id=\"success\"></span></p>\n  <p>Fallos: <span id=\"fail\"></span></p>\n  <p>Duración media (ms): <span id=\"avg\"></span></p>\n</div>\n\n\n<script>\nfetch('/data/daily_summary.json')\n  .then(response => response.json())\n  .then(data => {\n    document.getElementById('total').textContent = data.total;\n    document.getElementById('success').textContent = data.success;\n    document.getElementById('fail').textContent = data.fail;\n    document.getElementById('avg').textContent = data.avg_duration_ms;\n  })\n  .catch(err => console.error('Error cargando JSON:', err));\n</script>\n\n\n<script>\nsetInterval(() => {\n  fetch('/data/daily_summary.json')\n    .then(response => response.json())\n    .then(data => {\n      document.getElementById('total').textContent = data.total;\n      document.getElementById('success').textContent = data.success;\n      document.getElementById('fail').textContent = data.fail;\n      document.getElementById('avg').textContent = data.avg_duration_ms;\n    });\n}, 5000);\n</script>\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1778744354078}}
