{"type":"message","id":"a11e8b8f","parentId":"c08a84a7","timestamp":"2026-05-14T19:51:09.278Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Summarizing findings**\n\nI need to review the findings and consider offering some cleanup. The user asked for a review, so I should read through enough to understand the issues. I noticed malformed HTML in the style, and I found duplicate RAG blocks outside of the HTML section, along with a changed token. I’ll mention that there are no modifications but could inspect to see if the files have changed. That should cover what I need to address!","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a0627a6cc048191a25493c81b389fc3\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABqBieo4l70uIY4luP4wq6ziYzWxwpTHEpeUhelHx-aKjumaG4HDsBYk2lsjYF0ePQG7rVDkYL8AZe2nguCXCQV4aFyFC7B3Nx9kDqWEW-SaRnQuyYsnC9dBda5OG_ZKe-vgbJaYZD97snDhCzpwtanUKquB_FNSSE9SL5usTHQxmh2K83cNMMxvS5uz8NKQbdBkInEAn3nhiU9L4USVuKBJo_ixgTXJQnpf2aRdV17akZebHICrhU3mSddZdZ0ATWTUGczkTAPOUmhMhMrwZlfQBiSHSzneLN9fbMkX1TXdw5agfG50TCGpXFhfFY6-mpV335WvRiBFSjWiuJXXa5gOv5hZrUNWDVrTYXPmiTav8zwcdA4ANMfzTF772cu1fNSj-mT2IC8i_4Jmq3NIK2GltswVV1mWVT_9cw08lnh4554cPGAaeA738VHuc_fDUFSYFa7b4nk-B5cvfEQqyepuEvc5T4d03dY2V3YuwzKiHiy10J95qJbS3gnVSAqTAfgjb9Ll-Bg7rVShcAA3LrQgA9ptEyOgsygTZKi20P6x1zIia4znEiPnVhy13KGZi5UAl34dIr1X284TOvt-O5azol8O3XglvbgGZ3mLaYzBJMTI8r52tLeO5kihxxseQeTQUNvfcuZMoREqhau4VpbH_qHhTqYJtMfAdbmpWqVi-lXms17a_mO_kUol0BYlITYKFdVe9hzXPfU60gAo2M96n_wb0FJ-IQFTYlpbB-UJAZf6KutO2Ud-SUP9lqqkX-SKt8OaOaTptrH6_H-Bx3mG4_hAo6KXYQSQfGZ_kYb3qaHzeA7pdN_Coquo68y7qLV6fkEpB5DdRVGhMzCoZSUJw1s6mRCf_w7dB7Zxe658bHO5DvpRFGp40Q2twrVl1kZjV1Tb9IIMBhOd-STIVGgygsea9KqpUooq_Fhada3d1tUfONmBrUrEqUZ_Fb7s0lnv8RPZrt67lx6FpHJPl3tC8plNLSdp0NAyhnf0AULaYVT8BGZ3mxvd941kkyhTVQFd4Sv_ijFO61Z0b2zvyT2MOEEZDWDT3ZPoi1xEEzgXIdWAOB8Sww660_kC_CMZIZGmmaFg4nkVISYZ3zQCr3oq1hqO6IAV4D9LSRc4sGXZ6DpNo4CtjM9kVh9vGfvszsAeAiWn7jH4TZnSapZWfd8bUFOV3v8fsXs4fhULke_bl5Jl-AiwZL6xpCWvID3Mym-8zHxMqLH4pv1OCY0Ecm4s89n2f-uCX5hwh7FEr-DxSdB4XU=\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Summarizing findings**\\n\\nI need to review the findings and consider offering some cleanup. The user asked for a review, so I should read through enough to understand the issues. I noticed malformed HTML in the style, and I found duplicate RAG blocks outside of the HTML section, along with a changed token. I’ll mention that there are no modifications but could inspect to see if the files have changed. That should cover what I need to address!\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]]Sí, hay novedades — y también algo de rotura estructural.\n\nHe visto:\n\n- Nuevo bloque **“Pregunta RAG”** dentro de `<main>`, pero insertado justo después del footer.\n- Nuevo bloque **“RAG local”** añadido **fuera de `</html>`**.\n- Nuevo script de **`rag-stats`** que inserta una barra al inicio del body.\n- `ragSearch()` aparece **duplicado**.\n- Hay HTML metido por error dentro del `<style>`:\n  ```html\n  <div class=\"dashboard-block\">\n  </div>\n  ```\n  Esto rompe CSS/HTML.\n- Hay un cierre extra al final:\n  ```html\n  </div>\n  ```\n- El token frontend cambió de `neodaemon123`/oculto a:\n  `neodaemon-secure-token`\n- `daily_summary.json` también cambió:\n  - total: 7\n  - success: 6\n  - interrupted: 1\n  - avg_duration_ms: 3506\n\nNo he tocado nada.\n\nMi lectura: alguien/algún proceso añadió funcionalidades RAG rápido, pero quedaron fuera de la estructura limpia del dashboard. Recomiendo una limpieza controlada: integrar **RAG local**, **Pregunta RAG** y **RAG stats** dentro de un bloque “RAG” del dashboard, eliminar duplicados y dejar un único script.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a0627a8fc3c8191be9d2d840f9808a5\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":6783,"output":354,"cacheRead":62464,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":69601,"cost":{"input":0.033915,"output":0.010620000000000001,"cacheRead":0.031232,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.075767}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778788261985,"responseId":"resp_0d75942cb9a8c0e2016a0627a6239c819190d6ca6b6149a0f1"}}
